        "evidence": "q-casimir-unique.lean:67-71 axiom QCasimir.unique_up_to_scalar_axiom has hypothesis only `_hC : forall a, C*a = a*C` (centrality) and concludes CasimirScalarEquiv d (QCasimir qs d) C — i.e. C = QCasimir + iota(r). It DROPS the eigenvalue-normalisation hypothesis the .md requires",
